these patches to make them effective. Most of them have already been merged into Armbian, so if you are using Armbian directly, you don’t need to worry about these issues. Rockchip VOP​ These patches fix the issue where the mainline kernel cannot use the RK3308B VOP’s built-in LCDC (LCD Controller) to output to a panel. rk3308-internal-rgb-lcdc.patch rk3308-vop-output.patch Rockchip UART​ This patch fixes the binding issue of UART DMA for RK3308B in the mainline kernel. rk3308-fix-uart-dma.patch","s":"Additional Patches","u":"/en/blog/001-linux-mainline-6.17-sakurapi-rk3308b","h":"#additional-patches","p":11}],"index":{"version":"2.3.9","fields":["t"],"fieldVectors":[["t/10",[0,0.751,1,1.567,2,1.567,3,1.567]],["t/12",[0,0.402,4,1.549,5,1.549,6,0.742,7,1.208,8,1.416,9,0.742,10,1.208,11,1.208,12,0.402,13,1.208,14,0.839,15,0.839,16,0.839,17,0.839,18,0.839,19,0.839,20,0.839,21,0.579,22,0.839,23,0.402,24,0.402,25,0.839,26,0.839,27,0.839,28,0.402,29,1.549,30,0.579,31,0.839,32,0.579,33,1.416,34,0.839,35,1.208,36,0.839,37,0.839,38,0.839,39,0.839,40,0.839,41,0.839]],["t/14",[6,0.567,9,0.39,12,0.567,21,0.39,23,0.39,24,0.39,28,0.857,30,0.39,32,0.567,42,0.814,43,1.392,44,0.814,45,0.814,46,0.814,47,0.814,48,1.182,49,0.814,50,0.814,51,0.814,52,1.182,53,1.182,54,0.814,55,0.814,56,0.814,57,0.814,58,1.392,59,1.392,60,1.392,61,1.182,62,0.814,63,0.814,64,1.182,65,0.814,66,0.814,67,1.182,68,0.814,69,1.392,70,0.814,71,0.814,72,1.392,73,1.182]]],"invertedIndex":[["17",{"_index":11,"t":{"12":{"position":[[43,2],[317,2]]}}}],["6",{"_index":10,"t":{"12":{"position":[[41,1],[315,1]]}}}],["adapt",{"_index":19,"t":{"12":{"position":[[166,10]]}}}],["add",{"_index":33,"t":{"12":{"position":[[385,3],[437,3],[479,3]]}}}],["alreadi",{"_index":51,"t":{"14":{"position":[[235,7]]}}}],["arm",{"_index":31,"t":{"12":{"position":[[370,3]]}}}],["arm64",{"_index":37,"t":{"12":{"position":[[457,5]]}}}],["armbian",{"_index":52,"t":{"14":{"position":[[260,7],[289,7]]}}}],["bind",{"_index":30,"t":{"12":{"positi